GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Books(10)

### 9. Test Unmanaged Entity (Orders)

# Kiểm tra audit fields tự xử lý trong service.js (createdAt, createdBy)
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 11,
  "quantity": 2,
  "book_ID": 10
}

### 10. Test Composition (Books–Chapters)

# Tạo Book kèm Chapters (Composition → vòng đời phụ thuộc)
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 12,
  "title": "CAP Advanced",
  "author": "Trainer",
  "stock": 5,
  "chapters": [
    { "ID": 101, "title": "Intro", "content": "Managed vs Unmanaged" },
    { "ID": 102, "title": "Deep Dive", "content": "Association vs Composition" }
  ]
}

### 11. Test Composition Delete

# Xóa Book → Chapters cũng bị xóa theo (do Composition)
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Books(10)

